C************************************************************************************************																									
C                       WATER USE PARAMETERS																									
C																									
C   The following lists the water use parameters for each subregion and agricultural crop type 																									
C																									
C   IR       ;  Subregion number																									
C   PERV     ;  Fraction of pervious area to total urban areas																									
C   ICPRECIP ;  Precipitation - this number corresponds to the appropriate data																									
C                column in the precipitation data file																									
C   ICRUFAG  ;  Fraction of the surface runoff from agricultural applied water 																									
C                that is re-used - this number corresponds to the appropriate data  																									
C                column in irrigation water re-use factor data file 																									
C   ICRUFURB ;  Fraction of the surface runoff from urban areas  																									
C                that is re-used - this number corresponds to the appropriate data  																									
C                column in irrigation water re-use factor data file																									
C   FURDPRF  ;  Fraction of urban return flow due to applied water that goes to deep percolation  																									
C		Not applicable to Ag lands  and set to 0 for municipalities that have WTP that discharge to creeks																							
C   FURDPSR  ;  Fraction of urban direct runoff due to precipitation that goes to deep percolation																									
C	PERV = 0.62 Set to 1.00 now to accomodate mismatch between IDC and RF-RO models for urban areas																								
C---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------																									
C                                                    ICRUFAG																									
C                         -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------																									
CIR    PERV   ICPRECIP AL	AP	CO	CR	CU	DB	FI	GR	OG	OR	PA	PO	RI	SB	SF	SO	TH	TM	TR	VI   ICRUFURB  FURDPRF	FURDPSR					
C---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------																									
